Fixes a bug i encountered on Debian with Plasma 6.3 where the pairing wizard fails most pairing attempts. 

To use clone this repo and build by running install-patched.sh (it also installs the new binary)
No guarantees on anything!

BlueDevil runtime dependencies:
    -bluez5
        -General Bluetooth management

    -bluez-obexd
        -Be able to "Browse File" aka kio_obexftp
        -Be able to "Send Files" (bluedevil-sendfile)
        -Be able to receive files

    -pulseaudio-module-bluetooth
        -Be able to connect A2DP profile
